    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Master the Art of Soulslike Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/44b83c6d45b87af51e1e7304f174bfcd.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/44b83c6d45b87af51e1e7304f174bfcd.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/44b83c6d45b87af51e1e7304f174bfcd.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >V.E.D.A is a Soulslike game where you can train and learn the unique combat system.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only those who enjoy Soulslike games, but also those who try for the first time can enjoy the thrilling achievements.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through the rigorous training simulator, created by the super AI V.E.D.A, you can also experience the unique combined roguelike system.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Humanity\u2019s Last Hope - The Super AI V.E.D.A</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Supporting Agents With V.E.D.A\u2019s Motherhood</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/897fc760f88f01930746bdbe512f92a0.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/897fc760f88f01930746bdbe512f92a0.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/897fc760f88f01930746bdbe512f92a0.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the near future, global warming caused an unfathomable disaster to humankind.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ancient virus destroyed 90% of humanity and now inhabited by bizarre mutated creatures with methane gas in the atmosphere.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The super intelligent AI V.E.D.A commenced the emergency training simulator to reclaim the surface, and you\u2019re the training agent!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you overcome V.E.D.A challenges and become the perfect agent?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But\u2026 What secrets are V.E.D.A hiding from you?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat That Demands Precision and Mastery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep, Immersive Soulslike Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/b5786a7c82a4dd353849a646b4f36cc1.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/b5786a7c82a4dd353849a646b4f36cc1.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/b5786a7c82a4dd353849a646b4f36cc1.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack, dodge, and parry with pinpoint accuracy. Every encounter demands focus, strategy, and mastery of your weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Overclock \u2013 Unleash Devastation</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/ffe2799e9c5938e501d74834be52618b.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/ffe2799e9c5938e501d74834be52618b.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/ffe2799e9c5938e501d74834be52618b.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Charge your Overclock gauge and activate powerful, battle-turning abilities embedded in your weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Timing is everything\u2014strike at the perfect moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bosses That Break You\u2014Or Make You</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/d63b99e1141421d35074cbc5ce027343.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/d63b99e1141421d35074cbc5ce027343.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/d63b99e1141421d35074cbc5ce027343.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every trial culminates in a fierce boss battle that will test everything you\u2019ve learned.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt, endure, and emerge victorious.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Forge Your Own Combat Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose Your Arsenal</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/4673eed5ff5239b722c82d381b6f36ff.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/4673eed5ff5239b722c82d381b6f36ff.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/4673eed5ff5239b722c82d381b6f36ff.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of weapons, armor, and items to craft a playstyle that suits you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your rhythm, experiment with different loadouts, and dominate the battlefield your way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelike Training Program Like No Other</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train, Adapt, Overcome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/cde248d46305e0144533a26ba2a4ee0a.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/cde248d46305e0144533a26ba2a4ee0a.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/cde248d46305e0144533a26ba2a4ee0a.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the very end of the standard training, V.E.D.A will put you to the test to become the perfect combat agent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive in every procedurally generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize randomly placed items to finish the ultimate training.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Challenge Awaits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is calling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the challenge, master the art of combat, and uncover the truth behind <strong>V.E.D.A</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the simulator. Train, fight, and prove your worth.</strong></p>",
