rong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/4673eed5ff5239b722c82d381b6f36ff.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/4673eed5ff5239b722c82d381b6f36ff.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/4673eed5ff5239b722c82d381b6f36ff.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield a variety of weapons, armor, and items to craft a playstyle that suits you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your rhythm, experiment with different loadouts, and dominate the battlefield your way.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Roguelike Training Program Like No Other</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Train, Adapt, Overcome</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/cde248d46305e0144533a26ba2a4ee0a.poster.avif?t=1753845928\" width=608 height=254 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/cde248d46305e0144533a26ba2a4ee0a.webm?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2659980/extras/cde248d46305e0144533a26ba2a4ee0a.mp4?t=1753845928\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the very end of the standard training, V.E.D.A will put you to the test to become the perfect combat agent.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must survive in every procedurally generated maps</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize randomly placed items to finish the ultimate training.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Challenge Awaits</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is calling.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you rise to the challenge, master the art of combat, and uncover the truth behind <strong>V.E.D.A</strong>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enter the simulator. Train, fight, and prove your worth.</strong></p>",
